#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:8
msgid "Hash-o-matic"
msgstr "Hash-o-matic"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:9
msgid "Check hashes for your files"
msgstr "Provjerite sažetke svojih datoteka"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:24
msgid "Verifying that a file you downloaded or received is actually the one you were expecting is often overlooked or too time-consuming to do. At the same time, it has become very easy to get your hands on a file that has been tampered with, due to the mass increase of malicious webpages and other actors."
msgstr "Često se zanemaruje ili smatra previše dugotrajnim provjeriti je li preuzeta ili primljena datoteka doista ona koju ste očekivali. Istodobno je zbog naglog porasta zlonamjernih web-stranica i drugih aktera postalo vrlo lako doći do izmijenjene datoteke."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:30
msgid "This tool aims to solve that. Hash-o-matic comes with a simple &amp; clean UI, allowing anyone, from any age and experience group, to generate, compare and verify MD5, SHA-256 and SHA-1 hashes."
msgstr "Ovaj alat nastoji riješiti taj problem. Hash-o-matic ima jednostavno i pregledno korisničko sučelje koje svakome, bez obzira na dob i iskustvo, omogućuje generiranje, usporedbu i provjeru sažetaka MD5, SHA-256 i SHA-1."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:35
msgid "Hash-o-Matic also support verifying a file with the help of a PGP signature."
msgstr "Hash-o-Matic podržava i provjeru datoteka pomoću PGP potpisa."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:42
msgid "Generate checksums"
msgstr "Generiranje kontrolnih zbrojeva"

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:46
msgid "Compare two files"
msgstr "Usporedba dviju datoteka"

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:50
msgid "Verify the validity of a file"
msgstr "Provjera valjanosti datoteke"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:69
msgid "This new release of Hash-o-Matic provides updated translations and some small visual changes."
msgstr "Ovo novo izdanje programa Hash-o-Matic donosi ažurirane prijevode i manje vizualne izmjene."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:75
msgid "Initial release of Hash-o-Matic containing a hash generator mode, a file comparison mode and a verification mode."
msgstr "Prvo izdanje programa Hash-o-Matic s načinima rada za generiranje sažetaka, usporedbu datoteka i provjeru."
